# Todo List com Tags — Project Overview

Monorepo: **Vue 3 frontend** + **Node.js/Express backend** + **JSON file persistence**.

```
frontend/  → Vue 3 + Vite + Pinia + Vue Router + Tailwind + SortableJS
backend/   → Express REST API (modular routes) + fs.promises → data/data.json
```

## Commands

```bash
npm run install:all   # first-time setup
npm run dev           # backend :3001 + frontend :5173
```

Login: `admin` / `admin` — http://localhost:5173

## Data Flow

Frontend (Pinia stores) → REST API → `backend/data/data.json`

## Key Conventions

- IDs generated with `Date.now()` on backend
- Todos: `tagIds[]`, `pinned`, `archived`, `done`, email notification fields
- Custom order via `todoOrder[]`; drag-and-drop only in list view mode
- Auth: localStorage session, no JWT (personal-use app)
- Env: root `.env` (copy from `.env.example`); `VITE_API_URL`, `PORT`, optional `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `API_KEY`
- Minimize scope; match existing Composition API + `<script setup>` patterns

